  "short_description": "<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2095\">Handmade bamboo dish inlaid with Mother of Pearl. A fusion of natural elegance and craftsmanship — ideal for serving, gifting, or decoration.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"573\">This elegant <strong data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"364\">bamboo dish with Mother of Pearl (MOP) inlay</strong> is a unique fusion of natural craftsmanship and luxurious detail. Handcrafted from sustainable bamboo and delicately inlaid with shimmering pieces of MOP, each dish is a one-of-a-kind piece of functional art.</p>\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"852\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"651\">serving dry food, holding jewelry, or as a decorative accent</strong>, this dish fits beautifully in both contemporary and traditional settings. Lightweight, durable, and environmentally friendly, it’s ideal for eco-conscious brands, boutiques, and hospitality projects.</p>\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1023\">Each product is crafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans using traditional bamboo weaving and MOP inlay techniques — reflecting both cultural heritage and premium quality.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1108\">OEM and ODM options available for custom shapes, finishes, packaging, and branding.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1137\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1137\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1466\">\n<li data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1184\">\n<p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1184\">Made from natural, sustainable <strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1182\">bamboo</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1236\">\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1236\">Hand-inlaid with real <strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1234\">Mother of Pearl (MOP)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1290\">\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1290\">Elegant, shimmering finish — each piece is unique</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1340\">\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1340\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1338\">serving, decorating, or gifting</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1384\">\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1384\">Lightweight, durable, and biodegradable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1428\">\n<p data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1428\">Handmade by skilled artisans in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1466\">\n<p data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1466\">Customizable for <strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1466\">OEM/ODM buyers</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1471\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1507\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1505\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1683\">We offer competitive pricing and flexible MOQ for wholesalers, importers, and hospitality suppliers.<br data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1611\" />📧 Email: <strong data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1648\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1646\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong><br data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1651\" />🌐 Website: <strong data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1683\"><a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1681\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></strong></p>",
